      "title": "Why Pseudoscience Is Everywhere",
      "gist": "Despite the age of science, many people believe in mysticism, ESP, and untested theories of schooling and crime, and experts' pseudoscience intimidates ordinary people.",
      "question": "Pseudoscience — why do people still believe so much that doesn't work? (a personal survey)"
