      "title": "The Cargo Cult Analogy",
      "gist": "Like islanders building replica runways that bring no planes, some fields copy the forms of scientific investigation but lack something essential, so results never arrive.",
      "question": "Cargo Cult Science — what is missing when research looks scientific but yields nothing? (an analogy)"
    },
